            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Juli Lanzotti Yelnick"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Found this recipe to get rid of some evap milk, then ended up using half and half instead. Oh well. Liked the soup after some modifications--No mushrooms. Used tops of green onions, too. Sub out Tarragon and instead used cayenne pepper and celery seed. Stir in 1/2 cup mozzarella in final step. Top with shredded asiago cheese."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Liz Dalton 'Lizzie'"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Interesting ingredients! I'm thinking you can add any veggies and this would be good. I had to add a cup of chicken broth to this to thin it out a bit. I used red Quinoa because that's what was on sale. Will make again!",
            "datePublished": "2019-01-31T03:30:16.293Z"
          },
          {
